#
# Synthex Linux Kernel Configuration
# Architecture: x86_64
# Optimized for: desktop, gaming, containers, Wayland
# Scheduler: BORE + EEVDF
# Baseline: x86_64-v3, optional v4
#

#
# General Setup
#
